The '''Campfire''' allows players to craft [[Potions]] and other consumables with unlocked recipes, which are obtained from the Note in a Bottle through [[Fishing]]. It can be crafted in the inventory using one [[Wooden Plank]], and expires after 5 minutes.

== Crafting Menu ==
There are six available recipes, which include the [[Fish Kebab]], [[Lava Potion]], [[Aggro Elixir]], [[Loot Seeker]], [[Berserkers Elixir]], and [[Fortune Elixir]].  
