== Oni Campfire ==
A special version, the '''Oni Campfire''', exists in the [[Oni Realm]]. It has a red flame instead of an orange one and allows crafting of the [[Oni Soul]], [[Monk Potion]], and [[Invisibility Potion]]. Unlike regular campfires, the Oni Campfire does not expire.

== Celestial Campfire ==
A special version, the '''Celestial Campfire''', exists in the [[Celestial Domain]]. It has a red flame instead of an orange one and allows crafting of the [[Gate Potion]], [[Materials Elixir]], and [[Fragments Elixir]]. Unlike regular campfires, the Celestial Campfire does not expire.

== Trivia ==
* Campfires can be used early in the game, since wooden planks can be obtained at a low chance without the [[Shipwright]] subclass as of [[Updates/27.0|Update 27]].  
* When a campfire is about to expire, a message appears: ''"Your campfire's flames have been extinguished..."''  
* Other players can use a campfire placed by someone else.  
* If the Craft Menu is open and the player walks away, the menu will close automatically.  
* There are currently six available recipes as of Update 27.0.  
* Crafting every recipe once requires 18 [[Fish]] (1 [[Rare]], 4 [[Uncommon]], and 13 [[Common]]), 1 [[Leather]], 1 [[Scrap Metal]], and 1 [[Fish Tail]].  
* The [[Monk Potion]], [[Invisibility Potion]], and [[Oni Soul]] are exclusive to the Oni Campfire.  
* The [[Gate Potion]], [[Fragments Elixir]] and [[Materials Elixir]] are exclusive to the Celestial Campfire.  

